# Dynamite Diver (printed power 1) "saddles Mounts ... as though its power were 2 greater" (CR 702.171): exactly the 3 that Dracosaur
# Auxiliary's Saddle 3 asks. A Savannah Lions (power 2, one short) cannot saddle alone on turn 3 (refusal); the Diver alone can (positive
# control, at the limit). The saddled, hasty Dracosaur attacks: 4 combat damage, and "attacks while saddled" deals 2 more to Bot2 (20 -> 14).

